---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — The Little AI Company"
  description="The Little AI Company is an independent software studio building practical tools for real AI work."
>
  <section class="about">
    <span class="eyebrow">// about</span>
    <h1>We are a little company that makes real software.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The Little AI Company is an independent software studio. We build practical tools
      for people doing serious work with AI — especially the parts that need to survive
      beyond one chat: memory, handoffs, ownership, and evidence.
    </p>

    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <ul class="beliefs">
      <li>
        <b>Useful before impressive.</b> We start with a real job, make the smallest thing
        that can do it honestly, and show what still does not work.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Your work should stay yours.</b> We prefer local, inspectable systems and clear
        ownership over magical infrastructure nobody can examine.
      </li>
      <li>
        <b>Receipts beat claims.</b> AI systems should preserve source, limits, state,
        corrections, and proof — not ask people to trust a confident black box.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Software first. Education alongside it.</h2>
    <p class="body">
      We publish guides because the lessons behind the products are useful too. But the
      company is not a course catalog. The center of gravity is the software: Bellamente,
      Agent Relay, and the next practical thing that earns its way out of the workshop.
    </p>

    <p class="trustline">
      Small company. Real software. Honest release state.
    </p>

    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/projects">See the projects →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/guides">Browse the guides</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 0 40px; }
  .about h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px); font-weight: 900; margin: 16px 0 0; }
  .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 19px; margin: 20px 0 8px; }
  .about h2 { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; margin: 40px 0 14px; }
  .body { font-size: 17px; }
  .beliefs { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
  .beliefs li {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 16px 18px; font-size: 16px;
  }
  .trustline { margin-top: 36px; color: var(--green); font-weight: 600; }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>
